(7649624, 1244031, 3306, '<td valign="top">Such an interesting pattern. I find myself transfixed on its natural complexity.</td>', 'Such an interesting pattern. I find myself transfixed on its natural complexity.', '2020-01-06 06:54:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7649625, 1243996, 3306, '<td valign="top">Amazing clarity out of a window. It doesnt surprise me that your image is on the front page.</td>', 'Amazing clarity out of a window. It doesnt surprise me that your image is on the front page.', '2020-01-06 06:56:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(7649626, 1244159, 3306, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the ribbon. Its interesting how nature repeats its patterns. This almost looks like the eye of a hurricane viewed from space.</td>', 'Congrats on the ribbon. Its interesting how nature repeats its patterns. This almost looks like the eye of a hurricane viewed from space.', '2020-01-06 06:58:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(7649627, 1243963, 3306, '<td valign="top">Such an interesting place. The trees and bushes help to give perspective of size. Without them it would look like a mountain range. Good shot!</td>', 'Such an interesting place. The trees and bushes help to give perspective of size. Without them it would look like a mountain range. Good shot!', '2020-01-06 07:03:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(7649628, 1244195, 3306, '<td valign="top">This is stunning in B&amp;W. It really helps to draw out the pattern. Good eye!</td>', 'This is stunning in B&W. It really helps to draw out the pattern. Good eye!', '2020-01-06 07:05:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(7649629, 1244160, 3306, '<td valign="top">I did the same thing in opposite as you. I went out looking for a natural pattern to shoot and couldnt find anything so I had to fabricate one on the table! I like yours. Its nature as it should be!</td>', 'I did the same thing in opposite as you. I went out looking for a natural pattern to shoot and couldnt find anything so I had to fabricate one on the table! I like yours. Its nature as it should be!', '2020-01-06 07:10:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(7649631, 1244113, 3306, '<td valign="top">Don''t feel bad about the score. It''s a learning process! There are some  good elements to this picture. It was just the wrong challenge for it.</td>', 'Don''t feel bad about the score. It''s a learning process! There are some  good elements to this picture. It was just the wrong challenge for it.', '2020-01-06 07:53:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(7649632, 1243971, 3306, '<td valign="top">Sorry. This image just did not stand out for me. That dull sky (not your fault) didn''t help. Also, Fractals usually show a more consistent discernible pattern. This is more irregular. Maybe you could have cropped it in a little to identify the pattern you wish to exemplify?</td>', 'Sorry. This image just did not stand out for me. That dull sky (not your fault) didn''t help. Also, Fractals usually show a more consistent discernible pattern. This is more irregular. Maybe you could have cropped it in a little to identify the pattern you wish to exemplify?', '2020-01-06 08:03:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(7649633, 1244192, 181505, '<td valign="top">Fabulous image! Congrats on your yellow!!</td>', 'Fabulous image! Congrats on your yellow!!', '2020-01-06 09:14:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(7649634, 1244013, 181505, '<td valign="top">I am in awe of the creativity and energy you expend to get these great shots! The back story about your juggler with the eggs was fascinating!! I went to your page and saw your first blue was done with lady bugs and superglue. WOW!! Photography should be fun and it is wonderful to see someone enjoying it to the fullest!! Congrats on another blue! I can''t wait to see the next one!!</td>', 'I am in awe of the creativity and energy you expend to get these great shots! The back story about your juggler with the eggs was fascinating!! I went to your page and saw your first blue was done with lady bugs and superglue. WOW!! Photography should be fun and it is wonderful to see someone enjoying it to the fullest!! Congrats on another blue! I can''t wait to see the next one!!', '2020-01-06 10:26:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(7649635, 1244031, 181505, '<td valign="top">I have seen a lot of photos of patterns on leaves but this one shows us that something different can be achieved with a common subject. Good work!</td>', 'I have seen a lot of photos of patterns on leaves but this one shows us that something different can be achieved with a common subject. Good work!', '2020-01-06 10:30:24.000000', NULL, 0),
